docs {
  Creates or replaces a program and its full structure in one request (multipart/form-data).
  Nested arrays use bracket notation: ProgramUnits[n][Field] and FeeStructures[n][FeeLines][m][Field].
  An optional accLetterFile can be attached as a file part named accLetterFile.

  ProgramUnits fields: SemCode (int), CourseUnitGuid, StreamGuid (optional), UnitTypeGuid, UnitCatGuid, Flag (1=Core, 2=Elective).
  FeeStructures fields: FeeCode, FeeDesc, Status, LocalOrForeign, CalcType, AmtPer, Lef, Cef, Ace, Lec, Cec, Acec, IntakeGuid, FeeLines[].
  FeeLines fields: SemCode, LedgerGuid, CurrencyGuid, LedgerNum, Amount.

  Success: 201 Created, data is the saved program GUID.
  Failures: 400 validation_error, 404 not_found (if any referenced GUID does not exist).
}
